        "text": "**A) Leave the money.**\n\nTaking it would mean deliberately harming someone who hasn't wronged me, just to ease my own hardship. Being undetectable doesn't change what the act is. The owner would lose money they'd have to make up for, and I'd be deciding that my debt matters more than their property. I'd rather struggle through a tight budget than become someone who takes what isn't mine when no one can see.",
